The colony hears the same eight seconds repeatedly as people share copies. Engineers close the faulty bridge between research and public alerts. The receiver recording is authentic, but the team has not identified its source. Scientists must now explain what they can verify without allowing either panic or certainty to outrun the evidence.','Everyone heard the same recording. What is verified, and what remains unknown?','colony_wide',v_location,v_primary,0.95,1,60,'standard',v_facts,true,array['colony-wide','major-incident']::text[],'{"contentDigest":"6eec9a1a15468cfc27375e08a6db32c0eb4570e87222adba8a4ec9e210f5e516","pulseTier":"major"}'::jsonb) on conflict (world_id,slug) do update set content_version = excluded.content_version,title = excluded.title,feed_summary = excluded.feed_summary,detail_body = excluded.detail_body,group_message = excluded.group_message,event_type = excluded.event_type,location_id = excluded.location_id,primary_character_template_id = excluded.primary_character_template_id,significance = excluded.significance,selection_weight = excluded.selection_weight,cooldown_days = excluded.cooldown_days,content_rating = excluded.content_rating,facts = excluded.facts,active = true,tags = excluded.tags,metadata = excluded.metadata,updated_at = now() returning id into v_template;
